H^2:    kappa = cos(y)  K = -1
        2 kappa^2 + K = cos(2*y)  = cos(2 phi): True
        e^{-2 sigma}(2 sigma'^2 - sigma'') - (2 kappa^2 + K) = 0
sphere: kappa = sinh(y)  K = 1
        (3 z^2 - 1)/(2 kappa^2 - K) = cosh(y)**(-2) (positive factor sech^2 u)
        e^{-2 sigma}(2 sigma'^2 + sigma'') - (2 kappa^2 - K) = 0
